{
    "a_galaxy_workflow": "true",
    "annotation": "This workflow takes paired-end Illumina fastq(.gz) files and removes host or contaminant reads (human, by default) with Bowtie2 (alignment), Deacon (minimizer-based depletion) or Deacon followed by Bowtie2. MultiQC aggregates the Bowtie2 mapping reports.",
    "comments": [],
    "creator": [
